<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>星云商城</title>

<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{
  margin:0;
  background:#0b1020;
  color:white;
  font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}
header{
  padding:20px;
  background:#151d31;
  font-size:23px;
  font-weight:bold;
  color:#a99aff;
}
.container{padding:20px}
.banner{
  padding:35px 22px;
  border-radius:18px;
  background:linear-gradient(120deg,#493b91,#17456d);
}
.banner h1{font-size:28px}
.banner p{color:#d4d9ef}
h2{margin-top:30px}
.products{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
  gap:14px;
}
.card{
  background:#19243a;
  border:1px solid #34415e;
  border-radius:14px;
  padding:16px;
}
.card h3{font-size:17px}
.price{
  color:#ff8da9;
  font-size:23px;
  font-weight:bold;
  margin:15px 0;
}
button{
  width:100%;
  padding:12px;
  border:0;
  border-radius:9px;
  background:#806fff;
  color:white;
  font-size:15px;
}
.notice{
  margin-top:25px;
  padding:18px;
  background:#19243a;
  border-radius:12px;
  color:#c3cce0;
}
footer{
  text-align:center;
  padding:30px;
  color:#78839b;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>✦ 星云商城</header>

<div class="container">

<section class="banner">
<h1>欢迎来到星云商城</h1>
<p>精选数字商品 · 便捷服务 · 安心购物</p>
</section>

<div class="notice">
<h3>📢 商城公告</h3>
<p>欢迎光临星云商城，请仔细阅读商品说明及购买须知。</p>
</div>

<h2>精选商品</h2>

<div class="products">

<div class="card">
<h3>月度会员</h3>
<p>数字会员服务</p>
<div class="price">¥29</div>
<button onclick="alert('演示页面，暂未开放购买')">立即购买</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>季度会员</h3>
<p>数字会员服务</p>
<div class="price">¥79</div>
<button onclick="alert('演示页面，暂未开放购买')">立即购买</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>半年会员</h3>
<p>数字会员服务</p>
<div class="price">¥139</div>
<button onclick="alert('演示页面，暂未开放购买')">立即购买</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>年度会员</h3>
<p>数字会员服务</p>
<div class="price">¥239</div>
<button onclick="alert('演示页面，暂未开放购买')">立即购买</button>
</div>

</div>
</div>

<footer>© 2026 星云商城</footer>

</body>
</html>
